    "description": "The fish length and stomach content prey count and prey length of age-0 Lake Whitefish (Coregonus clupeaformis) were collected in several regions of Lake Huron, Great Lakes between 2014-06-18 and 2018-07-05.  These fish were collected by the U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service (Alpena, MI) using Neuston nets or beach seines as part of routine larval coregonine surveys.  Subsamples of fish were transferred to NOAA/GLERL where diet analysis took place.",
